<title>USA: Dynamic Imaging Systems splits stock.</title>
<headline>Dynamic Imaging Systems splits stock.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dynamic Imaging Systems Inc said on Thursday it had split its common stock two shares for one on Wednesday, to holders of record that day.</p>
<p>The split increased the outstanding shares of common stock to 4.2 million, the company said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
